[@8]
<h2>~rSpy</h2>
<p>
Uh oh...

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>An Unexpected Guest</h2> 
<i>"Spies are cunning, but only tools."<br>
--Peter Wartensburg, Professional Spy</i>
<p>You are disturbed in the night by an Enemy Island.
Destroy this fool!

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations! Victory!</h2> 
<p>Just before the Spy had perished, he told you of Lord Gunton's growing power in the south.
It is time to head there and see what is about.
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b2

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
Looks like your adventure has ended even before it has started!
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
